:: Catalyst Night 2 [event main_quest] {"position":"5325,500","size":"100,100"}
/* Quest "The Catalyst Night" (main_catalystNight), part 2 of 2, STAGE1_PROPOSAL.md 5.8, one event with 6.6. Home, later that
   night. $mom.callName is in the kitchen. In her, the Catalyst (her entry of the device list) finds the need to be wanted, not
   lust. I tell her the truth in a way she can't refuse: she's been good for weeks, and she's wanted. If she went to the gym
   dinner ($mom.flags.gymDinner), that's where I start. Their first full sex scene, in her bed. Afterwards she doesn't make a
   rule this time, and that's what I notice. Her milestone into corruption stage 2 (Willing). Both lines move on by their
   wait quests.
   EXPLICIT blocks: the act itself is left for the author. Each block says what happens in it, how she reacts and what
   the text around it already covers, so the written part can slot in without repeating it. The thread through all of
   them: every time she tries to make it about him, he turns it back to her. Tonight is about her being wanted. */
<<silent>><<SetBackground $locations[3].img>><</silent>>
She's at the kitchen table with a cup of tea she's stopped drinking and the company calendar open on her tablet, color-coding next week. Her reading glasses are pushed up into her hair. She's in the big robe, the thick one, and her feet are bare on the cold tiles.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "There you are, honey. Your $sister.relation came in singing, and I mean really singing, she did the high part and everything. Did something good happen at the office?" },
{ who: $player, text: "Yeah. We finished the Catalyst today." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Oh, that's wonderful! Although you've both been working much too hard on that thing, and don't think I haven't noticed you living on crackers from the vending machine." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

The Catalyst is in my jacket pocket, with about half its charge left. I sit down across from her at the table, and while she's telling me about the client who wants everything in triplicate, I reach into my pocket and press the button.

<<UseQuestDevice $player "mom">>

<<linkreplace "Tell her">>
In $sister.callName the Catalyst found love. In $mom.callName, if I'm reading her right, it finds something older and quieter: the wish to be wanted, which is a different thing from being needed. She's been needed her whole life, by $dad.callName, by us, by her old boss, by this company, but I don't think anybody has wanted her in a long time, and I'd bet she knows exactly how long.

<<if $mom.flags.gymDinner === true>>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $player, text: "I keep thinking about that dinner with $gymOwner.name." },
{ text: "Her pen stops on the screen." },
{ who: $player, text: "You sat across from that man for a whole evening, and I'd bet the entire time you were wondering whether I'd be happy with how you handled him." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Honey, that's not... well." },
{ who: $player, text: "Were you?" },
{ who: $mom, text: "Of course I was. I kept thinking, what would he want me to do now, is this all right, and then the waiter came with the bread basket and I nearly knocked my wine into his lap." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>
<</if>>

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $player, text: "You've been so good these last few weeks. The rounds, the mornings, everything I asked you for, you just did it, and you never once made me feel bad for asking." },
{ text: "She puts the tablet down. Her hands find each other on the table." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Well, I've only been doing what you needed, honey. That's all I ever want to do." },
{ who: $player, text: "I know. But that's not what I'm trying to say. What I'm trying to say is that I want you." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

She goes completely still.

I can see it land. Whatever the Catalyst is doing in her, it looks like it's taking a feeling that's been sitting at the bottom of her for twenty years and turning it up, slowly, until it's all she can hear. Her lips part and her eyes fill, and she looks at me the way she looks at that old photo of $dad.callName, the one from the party where he walked all the way across the house to find her in the kitchen.

<<linkreplace "Wait">>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "Sweetheart, you can't say things like that to me, I'm your... it's late, and you've had such a long day, let me at least heat you up some of the..." },
{ who: $player, text: "I don't want anything heated up, $mom.callName. You're the most beautiful woman I know, and I want you, and I'm tired of pretending I don't." },
{ text: "She makes a sound that's half a laugh and half something else, and covers her mouth with her hand." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Nobody's said anything like that to me in, oh, I don't even know how long. Years and years, honey." },
{ who: $player, text: "Well, I'm saying it now, and I mean it." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

She takes her hand away from her mouth and looks at the stairs, toward $sister.callName's room, where the shower has stopped. Then she looks back at me, stands up and holds out her hand.

<<linkreplace "Take her hand">>
She leads me up the stairs with her fingers laced through mine, and on the landing she stops so suddenly that I nearly walk into her. $sister.callName's door is closed, with a line of light under it and music playing very faintly behind it.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "She's still awake, honey. She's right there, and if she comes out for a glass of water and sees us..." },
{ who: $player, text: "Then we'll be quiet." },
{ text: "She looks at the door, then at me, and her hand tightens around mine instead of letting go." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<Media "images/characters/mom/events/catalyst_night/bed_0.mp4" 600>>
/* Her bedroom, the lamp low, Mom letting the robe fall, standing at the foot of her bed */
She closes her bedroom door so slowly that the latch doesn't click, and turns the lamp down to its lowest setting. She takes the reading glasses out of her hair, folds them and lines them up next to her alarm clock, very neatly, the way she does every night. Then she stands at the foot of the bed she shared with $dad.callName, unties the robe, which she's knotted twice, and lets it fall.

She's never stood in front of me like this without being told to, and she doesn't cover anything. She does start talking, though.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "I'm not exactly what I was at twenty-five, you know, honey. Things have moved around a bit, gravity's had twenty years to work on all of this, and I keep telling myself I'll get back into the yoga, but then there's always a client or the laundry or..." },
{ who: $player, text: "You're not going to talk me out of this by listing everything you think is wrong with you." },
{ text: "She laughs, shakily, and wipes one eye with her knuckle." },
{ who: $mom, text: "No, I suppose I'm not. Come here, then." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<linkreplace "Let her undress me">>
She undresses me the way she does everything, carefully and a little too efficiently, and halfway through she catches herself folding my shirt and laying it over the back of her chair. She stares at it. Then she starts laughing without making a sound, with her forehead against my shoulder, until I'm laughing too.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "Twenty years of laundry, honey. My hands just don't know any better." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

She lies back on her own bed and pulls me down with her, and for a moment she just holds my face in both hands and looks at me, as if she's memorizing something. Then she kisses me, and it's nothing like the kiss she puts on my forehead. She kisses me like a woman who wants someone.

/* EXPLICIT 1, foreplay. Kissing and touching on her bed, the lamp low. She starts out attentive to him (that's who she
   is: she wants to make it good for him, keeps asking if this is all right). He doesn't let her. He turns it around and
   makes it about her body and her pleasure, and she has no idea what to do with being the one attended to: she's
   flustered, tries to give back, he stops her. Her reactions: surprise first, then she lets go a little at a time.
   Keep her quiet because of the room next door (her own hand, the pillow). The paragraph below follows on from it. */
<<Media "images/characters/mom/events/catalyst_night/bed_1.mp4" 600>>
/* In her bed, her arms around his neck, her face turned toward him */

Every time she tries to turn it back toward me, to make sure I'm comfortable, to ask if I want something else, I don't let her. It takes her a while to understand that I mean it, and once she does, I see her not know what to do with her hands for the first time in my life.

<<linkreplace "Don't let her look away">>
/* EXPLICIT 2, the sex. Slow and careful at first, her on her back, holding his face, then she stops being careful.
   Positions and how long are yours; one change of position is plenty. Her: she says his name again and again (not
   loud), holds on to his shoulders, is surprised by herself. The Chat below runs during it, and the floorboard beat
   after it comes in the middle of it, so write the first part before the Chat and the rest after the floorboard. */

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $player, text: "Keep your eyes open. I want you to know it's me." },
{ who: $mom, text: "I know it's you, honey. I've known it's you for..." },
{ text: "She doesn't finish. She hides her face in my neck instead, and when she comes back up she's crying a little and smiling, both at once." },
{ who: $mom, text: "I wanted this. I don't even know since when, I didn't let myself know it, isn't that silly? A grown woman with a mortgage, and I didn't let myself know." },
{ who: $player, text: "You're allowed to know it now." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

Somewhere in the middle of it the hallway floor creaks, and we both freeze. She has a hand clamped over her own mouth and her eyes are huge over her fingers. We listen to nothing for what feels like a full minute. Then the pipes knock in the wall, the way they have every night for as long as I can remember.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "It's the house. It does that, it's always done that, your $dad.callName kept promising he'd call someone about it." },
{ text: "Then she hears what she just said, and whose bed she said it in, and pulls me back down before either of us has to think about it." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<linkreplace "Hold on to her">>
/* EXPLICIT 3, the finish. Her first: she pulls him down against her and holds on with her whole body, shaking, and has
   to bite down on something (his shoulder, the pillow) to stay quiet. Then him. The paragraph below picks up after. */

When it's over she doesn't let go. She keeps me where I am, her ankles hooked behind my knees, as if I might get up and leave the moment she loosens her grip.

<<linkreplace "Afterwards">>
She lies against me with her head on my chest. The lamp is still on. Her hair is all over the pillow, and she's tracing slow circles on my stomach with one finger, the same idle way $sister.callName played with my fingers on the gearshift a few hours ago, though neither of them will ever know that.

I wait for the rule. There's always one afterwards, just this once, or only when it gets bad, or only in my room, some little fence around what happened so she can live next to it.

She doesn't make one.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "Stay a little while, will you? Just until I fall asleep." },
{ who: $player, text: "Sure. I'm not going anywhere." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Good." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

That's all she says. She falls asleep holding my hand against her heart, and I lie there in the low light and listen to the house: the fridge, the old pipes, my $sister.relation turning over in bed on the other side of the wall.

In my jacket on her floor, the Catalyst has gone dark. If $brian.name's label is right, it didn't create anything tonight and only turned up what was already there, in both of them. I just didn't expect there to be so much of it.

<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 4>>
<<UpdateStat "-" "MomLust" 40>>
<<UpdateStat "-" "MomResistance" 4>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "Corruption" 3>>
<<Feel $mom "player" 3 "lasting">>
<<AdvanceCorruptionStage $mom "With the Catalyst on, I told her she's been good for weeks, and that I want her. She led me up to her own bed. Afterwards she didn't make a rule.">>
<<ProfileLog $mom "The Catalyst Night" "I switched the Catalyst on at the kitchen table and told her that I want her, which isn't the same as needing her. Nobody had said that to her in years. She took my hand, led me past both our doors to her own bed, and let the robe fall. Afterwards she didn't make a rule. She asked me to stay until she fell asleep.">>
<<ProfileMemory $mom "Wanted" "She said nobody had told her that in years and years. Then she stood up from the kitchen table and held out her hand.">>
